---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bgImage from '../assets/bg-home-3.png';
---

<section class="tech">
	<div class="tech__background">
		<Image src={bgImage} alt="" class="tech__bg-image" />
	</div>

	<div class="tech__container">
		<div class="tech__content">
			<h2 class="tech__title">
				<span class="tech__title--highlight">Tecnología</span> diseñada<br />
				para <span class="tech__title--highlight">condiciones reales</span>
			</h2>

			<p class="tech__description">
				Integramos <strong>Thermoliner Technology, Confort Mesh</strong> y <strong>Poliuretano</strong> de alta densidad para transformar tu experiencia de manejo.
			</p>

			<ul class="tech__features">
				<li class="tech__feature">
					<div class="tech__feature-header">
						<span class="tech__feature-title">Thermoliner Technology</span>
						<span class="tech__feature-dot"></span>
					</div>
					<p class="tech__feature-text">Reduce la acumulación de calor, garantizando hasta un 30% menos de temperatura superficial.</p>
				</li>
				<li class="tech__feature">
					<div class="tech__feature-header">
						<span class="tech__feature-title">Confort Mesh</span>
						<span class="tech__feature-dot"></span>
					</div>
					<p class="tech__feature-text">Mejora la posición y distribución de presión, brindando confort superior sin perder firmeza.</p>
				</li>
				<li class="tech__feature">
					<div class="tech__feature-header">
						<span class="tech__feature-title">Poliuretano de Alta Densidad</span>
						<span class="tech__feature-dot"></span>
					</div>
					<p class="tech__feature-text">Proporciona soporte constante y durabilidad; un núcleo que no se deforma con el uso prolongado.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.tech {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		overflow: hidden;
		margin-top: -30px;
		clip-path: polygon(0 30px, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
	}

	.tech__background {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.tech__bg-image {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: left center;
	}

	.tech__container {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 5rem 0 5rem 4rem;
	}

	.tech__content {
		max-width: 480px;
		text-align: right;
		background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		padding: 3rem;
		clip-path: polygon(8% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
	}

	.tech__title {
		font-family: 'Just Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		color: #1a1a1a;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
	}

	.tech__title--highlight {
		color: #ff4d00;
	}

	.tech__description {
		font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.1vw, 1.05rem);
		color: #444444;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
	}

	.tech__description strong {
		color: #1a1a1a;
	}

	.tech__features {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.tech__feature {
		text-align: right;
	}

	.tech__feature-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	.tech__feature-title {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1a1a1a;
	}

	.tech__feature-dot {
		width: 10px;
		height: 10px;
		background-color: #ff4d00;
		border-radius: 50%;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.tech__feature-text {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #555555;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.tech__container {
			padding: 3rem 0 3rem 0;
			justify-content: center;
		}

		.tech__content {
			max-width: 100%;
			text-align: center;
			clip-path: none;
			padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		}

		.tech__feature {
			text-align: center;
		}

		.tech__feature-header {
			justify-content: center;
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1440px) {
		.tech__container {
			max-width: 1400px;
			padding: 6rem;
		}

		.tech__content {
			max-width: 550px;
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1920px) {
		.tech__container {
			max-width: 1600px;
			padding: 8rem;
		}

		.tech__content {
			max-width: 620px;
		}
	}
</style>
